#Write a Python script that prints a WhatsApp-style multi-line message using escape characters 
# (\n and \t) to format the output like a chat conversation.
print("WhatsApp Chat\n\tAryan: Hi!\n\tNayana: Hello, how are you?\n\tAryan: I am good. What about you?\n\tNayana: I am good too!\n\tAryan: See you tomorrow.")